{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09023","headline":"休沐东还胄贵里示端 · 韦应物","name":"休沐东还胄贵里示端","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宦游三十载，田野久已疎。\n休沐遂兹日，一来还故墟。\n山明宿雨霁，风煖百卉舒。\n泓泓野泉洁，熠熠林光初。\n竹木稍摧翳，园场亦荒芜。\n俯惊鬓已衰，周览昔所娱。\n存没恻私怀，迁变伤里闾。\n欲言少留心，中复畏简书。\n世道良自退，荣名亦空虚。\n与子终携手，岁晏当来居。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09023.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09023","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}